---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | DigiiState OS">
	<main class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 py-24">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 bg-white border border-slate-200 p-16 rounded-[40px] shadow-sm">
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-950 uppercase tracking-tighter mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
			<div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg max-w-none">
				<p class="text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-12">Last Updated: August 20, 2026</p>
				
				<h3>1. Digital Lease Agreements & Ownership</h3>
				<p>Leasing a DigiiState territory constitutes a service agreement for exclusive lead flow. DigiiState Infrastructure Corp retains 100% ownership of the Digital Deed, including the domain name, website content, search engine positioning, and all technical metadata stored in our production database.</p>

				<h3>2. Payment Protocol & Account Standing</h3>
				<p>Monthly rent is due in advance on the 1st of each month. Accounts falling more than 48 hours into arrears will trigger automated suspension of lead routing via our Make.com triage engine. Re-activation requires full settlement of outstanding balances plus a $50 administrative recovery fee.</p>

				<h3>3. Termination & Data Reversion</h3>
				<p>Either party may terminate the lease with 30 days' notice. Upon termination, all rights to lead flow generated by the asset revert immediately to DigiiState. Any partner-specific data will be archived in accordance with our Privacy Policy.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
